WEBVTT

00:00:00.158 --> 00:00:01.408
[thunder cracks]

00:00:01.492 --> 00:00:03.658
[PHOENIX] Among Kurain
Village's sacred treasures

00:00:03.742 --> 00:00:06.783
is the "Shichishto," or
"Seven-Branched Sword."

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:10.325
This relic was forged to be
a symbol of life itself.

00:00:10.408 --> 00:00:12.325
Though our choices
may seem infinite,

00:00:12.408 --> 00:00:15.117
with possibilities branching
out in every direction.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.908
Much like our destinies,
the sword eventually leads

00:00:17.992 --> 00:00:19.367
to one end.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.783
It severs the delicate
thread that binds us

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:26.033
to this world without mercy,
and impales us with truth

00:00:26.117 --> 00:00:28.033
by slashing through
the fantasy that we can

00:00:28.117 --> 00:00:30.075
escape this grim fate.

00:02:13.283 --> 00:02:15.992
[MAYA] Wow, I am so glad Pearls
showed me this magazine,

00:02:16.075 --> 00:02:17.783
or I would've snoozed
on an awesome chance

00:02:17.867 --> 00:02:20.033
to give my spiritual
powers a boost!

00:02:20.117 --> 00:02:22.033
Thanks a million, Pearls!

00:02:22.117 --> 00:02:24.408
I'm just happy
that it makes you happy!

00:02:24.492 --> 00:02:25.575
[PHOENIX chuckles]

00:02:36.992 --> 00:02:39.950
[MAYA whimpers]
Oh, my goodness, Nick!

00:02:40.033 --> 00:02:41.950
I'll freeze to death
before we get there.

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:43.575
It's so cold!

00:02:43.658 --> 00:02:45.033
Ah-choo!

00:02:45.117 --> 00:02:46.783
Exactly why
I dressed for the weather.

00:02:46.867 --> 00:02:49.283
I'll just think of it as
my first phase of training!

00:02:49.367 --> 00:02:50.283
Ah-choo!

00:02:50.367 --> 00:02:51.700
That's the way!

00:02:51.783 --> 00:02:53.867
We're almost there, Mystic Maya,
you can tough it out!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:55.533
Yeah!

00:02:55.617 --> 00:02:57.950
[PHOENIX] Winter is cold enough
in the heart of the city,

00:02:58.033 --> 00:03:00.658
but here we are trudging through
the snow-capped mountains,

00:03:00.742 --> 00:03:03.158
all to support Maya
in her training.

00:03:03.242 --> 00:03:05.075
Oh! It's right up there.

00:03:05.158 --> 00:03:06.950
There's Hazakura Temple!

00:03:07.033 --> 00:03:08.408
[giggles]

00:03:08.492 --> 00:03:09.408
[PHOENIX chuckles]

00:03:09.492 --> 00:03:10.533
[gasps]

00:03:11.908 --> 00:03:14.033
[PEARL] This place was built
so spirit channelers

00:03:14.117 --> 00:03:18.158
from the Kurain school can
go get additional training.

00:03:18.242 --> 00:03:20.700
I-It's amazing!
We made it here alive!

00:03:20.783 --> 00:03:21.867
Ah-choo!

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:23.783
[BIKINI] Come in, come in,
right this way!

00:03:23.867 --> 00:03:25.533
Have a seat around the fire!

00:03:25.617 --> 00:03:26.992
We appreciate it, ma'am.

00:03:27.075 --> 00:03:29.867
[BIKINI] Well, we appreciate you
coming all this way.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:31.408
Now sit down, get cozy!

00:03:31.492 --> 00:03:32.617
Oh, yeah!

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.783
Now that is exactly
what the doctor ordered!

00:03:34.867 --> 00:03:36.908
Quit acting tough and
warm your bones, Nick!

00:03:36.992 --> 00:03:38.908
I'm not trying to act tough.

00:03:38.992 --> 00:03:42.242
[BIKINI]
Now. Let me introduce myself.

00:03:42.325 --> 00:03:45.283
I'm head nun at
our quaint little temple.

00:03:45.367 --> 00:03:46.700
My name is Bikini.

00:03:46.783 --> 00:03:47.700
Bi...

00:03:47.783 --> 00:03:49.450
--...ki...
--...ni?

00:03:49.533 --> 00:03:51.158
I wasn't born with that name!

00:03:51.242 --> 00:03:53.367
But I took it on when
I came to this temple.

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.408
Bi! Ki! Ni!

00:03:55.492 --> 00:03:57.200
Not what you expected, is it?

00:03:57.283 --> 00:03:59.742
Yep. It can be quite
a shock for some folks!

00:03:59.825 --> 00:04:01.200
[laughs]

00:04:01.283 --> 00:04:02.200
[GROUP chuckles]

00:04:02.283 --> 00:04:03.783
So who might you be?

00:04:03.867 --> 00:04:06.783
Me? I'm the one who signed up to
get some specialized training!

00:04:06.867 --> 00:04:08.450
[BIKINI] Aren't you
a brave little firecracker?

00:04:08.533 --> 00:04:10.575
Coming out here
in the deathly cold.

00:04:10.658 --> 00:04:12.783
Oh, to be so young and reckless!

00:04:12.867 --> 00:04:14.408
Don't blame me if you die.

00:04:14.492 --> 00:04:15.533
[cackles]

00:04:15.617 --> 00:04:16.783
What does she have to do?

00:04:16.867 --> 00:04:18.950
Chant Kurain mantras
while sitting on ice.

00:04:19.033 --> 00:04:21.283
Thirty thousand iterations!

00:04:21.367 --> 00:04:23.867
All while dousing herself
with freezing cold water.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.117
--[MAYA] Mm-hmm.
--[PHOENIX groans]

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.783
You could turn yourself
into a human popsicle,

00:04:26.867 --> 00:04:28.492
if you're not careful.

00:04:28.575 --> 00:04:31.533
[MAYA whines] But I don't
wanna be a human popsicle.

00:04:31.617 --> 00:04:33.242
Well, get comfortable.

00:04:33.325 --> 00:04:35.575
There's a little time
still before dinner.

00:04:35.658 --> 00:04:37.408
In that case,
I think a nice hot bath

00:04:37.492 --> 00:04:38.492
oughta thaw me out.

00:04:38.575 --> 00:04:40.283
Did you say "hot"?

00:04:40.367 --> 00:04:42.158
Oh, you youngsters
love to crack jokes.

00:04:42.242 --> 00:04:44.492
--[PHOENIX gasps]
--We do training here!

00:04:44.575 --> 00:04:46.575
And "hot bath"
is not part of that.

00:04:46.658 --> 00:04:48.658
You can shower in
the cold waterfall, though.

00:04:48.742 --> 00:04:50.700
[cackles]

00:04:50.783 --> 00:04:51.867
I'm dead...

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:52.992
[groans

00:04:53.075 --> 00:04:54.908
Maybe you can
boost your power, too!

00:04:54.992 --> 00:04:57.742
Oh, Mister Nick,
you'll always go through hell,

00:04:57.825 --> 00:05:00.367
or the coldest of water
to prove his devotion.

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:03.325
[ELISE] My, what an
adorable little acolyte.

00:05:05.742 --> 00:05:09.117
Do you mind if join you?
The fire's warm.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.783
No, not at all.

00:05:12.158 --> 00:05:14.158
Hey. Judging by your outfit.

00:05:14.242 --> 00:05:16.783
You must be here to
get a power up as well!

00:05:16.867 --> 00:05:20.533
[ELISE] Heh. Sounds delightful,
but no. I'm actually--

00:05:20.617 --> 00:05:21.617
[PEARL squeals]

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:22.617
Is something wrong?

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:25.242
Uh, sorry, ma'am. But...

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:28.533
I hope you don't mind me asking
if you're Elise Deauxnim?

00:05:28.617 --> 00:05:31.700
Oh. It makes me
so happy you know who I am.

00:05:31.783 --> 00:05:33.242
[PEARL squeals]

00:05:33.325 --> 00:05:36.242
[MAYA]
Do you know who she is, Nick?

00:05:36.325 --> 00:05:38.700
Well, she kinda looks like...
a fortune teller?

00:05:38.783 --> 00:05:40.617
[ELISE chuckles]
Good guess.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:43.242
But I'm a writer and illustrator
of children's books.

00:05:43.325 --> 00:05:45.658
Oh, neat. Like picture books?

00:05:45.742 --> 00:05:47.992
Looking at your drawings
is a purification ritual

00:05:48.075 --> 00:05:49.200
for my heart!

00:05:49.283 --> 00:05:50.617
That must be the most
beautiful compliment

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:51.617
I've ever received.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.492
[gasps]
I've thought about writing

00:05:53.575 --> 00:05:55.158
a children's book someday!

00:05:55.242 --> 00:05:56.783
Oh? When the time comes,

00:05:56.867 --> 00:05:59.117
you'll create a
beautiful piece of work.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:02.783
[MAYA gasps]
Well then, teach me your ways!

00:06:02.867 --> 00:06:04.033
Owie!

00:06:04.117 --> 00:06:06.367
Oh, no! Are you
hurt badly, my dear?

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:07.950
Nah. I'll be okay.

00:06:08.033 --> 00:06:11.075
[PHOENIX laughs] It's karma
for trying to ditch training.

00:06:11.158 --> 00:06:11.825
--[MAYA growls]
--Ah!

00:06:11.908 --> 00:06:12.908
Sorry 'bout that.

00:06:12.992 --> 00:06:14.117
I'm flattered.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.908
But I was just recently
asked by a young man

00:06:15.992 --> 00:06:17.408
if he could become
my apprentice.

00:06:17.492 --> 00:06:18.825
Oh, really?

00:06:18.908 --> 00:06:21.658
He even calls himself
Laurice Deauxnim.

00:06:21.742 --> 00:06:24.325
He's around here working
on his landscape sketches.

00:06:24.408 --> 00:06:25.700
So, then.

00:06:25.783 --> 00:06:28.117
Did you come here to do
research for your next book?

00:06:29.408 --> 00:06:32.867
Yes. I suppose
you could say that.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:35.367
Friends, you'll have
to excuse me for now.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.617
I promised to help with
dinner preparations.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:38.908
Wow, does that mean
you're going to be

00:06:38.992 --> 00:06:40.408
cooking for us tonight?

00:06:40.492 --> 00:06:42.950
Yes. So I hope you like curry.

00:06:43.033 --> 00:06:45.617
Oh! I'd love to
lend you a hand, if I could.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:46.825
That's so sweet.

00:06:46.908 --> 00:06:48.325
Ooh, let me help!

00:06:50.658 --> 00:06:52.158
The two of us will be fine.

00:06:52.242 --> 00:06:53.658
I think you should
see the inner temple,

00:06:53.742 --> 00:06:55.700
where your training
will be taking place.

00:06:55.783 --> 00:06:58.408
Well, sound good, Maya?

00:06:58.492 --> 00:07:00.617
[MAYA gasps]
Yeah!

00:07:04.617 --> 00:07:06.200
[BOTCH chuckles]

00:07:06.283 --> 00:07:08.700
Who knew little Pearl
would meet her idol here?

00:07:08.783 --> 00:07:12.450
I've never read her books
but I'm already a super fan!

00:07:12.533 --> 00:07:15.700
[PHOENIX] Look! That's
gotta be Dusky Bridge!

00:07:15.783 --> 00:07:19.367
[bridge creaks]

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:22.867
[MAYA] "Dusky" Bridge?
More like Spooky Bridge.

00:07:25.367 --> 00:07:26.325
What's wrong, Nick?

00:07:26.408 --> 00:07:28.117
You're like a weird
shade of green.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.617
Oh. That so?

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:32.242
Well, I don't do heights.
But I'm cool, though.

00:07:32.325 --> 00:07:33.325
Yeah.

00:07:34.533 --> 00:07:36.617
[PHOENIX]
As long as I don't fall over.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.075
[MAYA]
Just cross it, ya big baby!

00:07:38.158 --> 00:07:39.408
[PHOENIX]
No! Maya--

00:07:39.492 --> 00:07:43.408
[pants] There goes my
daily brush with death...

00:07:43.492 --> 00:07:47.075
[MAYA] Come on, Nick.
You're fine, so hurry!

00:07:49.117 --> 00:07:51.742
[MAYA]
Anyone here?

00:07:51.825 --> 00:07:54.200
[PHOENIX]
Looks pretty no frills to me.

00:07:54.283 --> 00:07:56.908
And that's a rockslide
just waiting to happen.

00:07:56.992 --> 00:08:00.158
[MAYA] But the Inner Temple's
Hermit Hall is strong! Yikes.

00:08:00.242 --> 00:08:02.450
I'm not so sure
"strong" was accurate.

00:08:02.533 --> 00:08:04.742
Is this really where
you're gonna be training?

00:08:04.825 --> 00:08:08.033
Creepy, huh?
Probably full of ghosts.

00:08:08.117 --> 00:08:10.158
[PHOENIX] Heh. A spirit-medium
that's afraid of ghosts

00:08:10.242 --> 00:08:11.658
is kinda ironic.

00:08:11.742 --> 00:08:14.075
[MAYA screams]
There's one!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.200
[gasps]

00:08:16.283 --> 00:08:18.075
[PHOENIX groans]

00:08:18.158 --> 00:08:19.242
[gasps]

00:08:20.283 --> 00:08:21.617
[PHOENIX gasps]

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.992
Whoa, awesome!
I think she's actually alive!

00:08:25.075 --> 00:08:26.200
Hi. I'm gonna be doing some

00:08:26.283 --> 00:08:28.158
advanced training
in here tonight.

00:08:28.242 --> 00:08:30.700
Oh. I'm Iris, one of the nuns.

00:08:30.783 --> 00:08:32.992
We're very glad to
have you at the temple.

00:08:33.075 --> 00:08:34.450
My name's Maya Fey.

00:08:34.533 --> 00:08:36.325
It's nice to meet you, Iris.

00:08:36.408 --> 00:08:38.033
Yes, you as well.

00:08:38.117 --> 00:08:40.575
Please excuse me,
I have chores to do.

00:08:40.658 --> 00:08:43.158
[PHOENIX]
Ah... Iris! Hang on a sec!

00:08:45.533 --> 00:08:46.825
[PHOENIX]
You wouldn't happen to--

00:08:46.908 --> 00:08:49.617
[MAYA] What? Nick, you
gotta check this out! Quick!

00:08:53.117 --> 00:08:55.325
[PHOENIX]
What am I looking at, exactly?

00:08:55.408 --> 00:08:57.575
That woman...

00:08:57.658 --> 00:08:59.658
It's her. It's my mom.

00:08:59.742 --> 00:09:00.950
[gasps]

00:09:01.033 --> 00:09:02.325
Ah!

00:09:02.408 --> 00:09:05.158
[MAYA] "Master of the Kurain
School of Channeling.

00:09:05.242 --> 00:09:06.533
Misty Fey."

00:09:06.617 --> 00:09:08.908
Is that really her?

00:09:08.992 --> 00:09:11.575
Do you see that crest
at the top of the scroll?

00:09:12.658 --> 00:09:15.575
[MAYA] That's the symbol
of a Kurain Master.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.033
[PHOENIX]
What is it?

00:09:21.117 --> 00:09:23.533
[MAYA]
That crest is how I knew.

00:09:23.617 --> 00:09:27.283
If it wasn't there, I'd have
no idea it was my mother.

00:09:27.367 --> 00:09:30.117
[sniffs]

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.700
I haven't seen her
in over 15 years,

00:09:32.783 --> 00:09:35.033
so I don't even
remember her face.

00:09:35.117 --> 00:09:38.075
[PHOENIX sighs]
Poor Maya...

00:09:40.408 --> 00:09:42.033
I am so glad that's over.

00:09:42.117 --> 00:09:45.200
You okay? You've turned
a different shade of green.

00:09:45.283 --> 00:09:47.867
Yeah. I'll probably
be fine eventually.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:50.700
[BUTZ]
Hey! Move it, you two!

00:09:50.783 --> 00:09:52.200
I'm working on
a landscape here,

00:09:52.283 --> 00:09:55.075
and you clowns are ruining it.
I'm not into portraiture--

00:09:55.158 --> 00:09:56.367
[gasps]

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.492
What the--? It's you!

00:09:58.575 --> 00:10:01.158
[BUTZ groans]
Hi! A pleasure to meet you.

00:10:01.242 --> 00:10:03.242
Uh... I'm Laurice Deauxnim!

00:10:03.325 --> 00:10:05.367
[PHOENIX] Are you insane?!
I know it's you, Larry!

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:06.992
--[blow lands]
--[BUTZ] Owie! Shut up!

00:10:07.075 --> 00:10:08.408
My name is Laurice!

00:10:08.492 --> 00:10:11.158
And I'm here to do an artistic
study of Dusky Bridge!

00:10:11.242 --> 00:10:14.242
[MAYA] Deauxnim?
Oh, are you the apprentice?

00:10:14.325 --> 00:10:16.242
[BUTZ]
Truth is...

00:10:16.325 --> 00:10:17.783
I was starting to feel
like I didn't wanna be

00:10:17.867 --> 00:10:19.867
ol' Larry Butz anymore.

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:21.533
And that's when
I discovered her books!

00:10:21.617 --> 00:10:23.742
Elise Deauxnim turned me
into a new man!

00:10:23.825 --> 00:10:26.450
Like your heart
had been purified? That it?

00:10:26.533 --> 00:10:29.367
Yeah! Exactly!
I have been reborn!

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:32.450
--[motor whirring]
--[ALL gasp]

00:10:32.533 --> 00:10:33.992
[PEARL squeals]

00:10:34.075 --> 00:10:36.033
Whoa! That is so cool!

00:10:36.117 --> 00:10:39.450
Hungry? It's time for everybody
to come and eat dinner!

00:10:39.533 --> 00:10:42.075
Meet us in the
Main Hall, if you please.

00:10:42.158 --> 00:10:44.658
Time to get some curry!

00:10:44.742 --> 00:10:46.492
Just who is she?

00:10:46.575 --> 00:10:48.492
She's a beautiful flower.

00:10:55.283 --> 00:10:57.075
[MAYA chomping]

00:10:57.158 --> 00:10:58.783
Here you go. Eat your fill.

00:10:58.867 --> 00:11:00.742
[PHOENIX]
She looks exactly like her.

00:11:00.825 --> 00:11:03.867
But there's no way.
That would be impossible!

00:11:06.658 --> 00:11:08.533
All right!
I'm stuffed to the gills

00:11:08.617 --> 00:11:10.742
with curry and ready
to start my training!

00:11:10.825 --> 00:11:13.450
Be careful.
Promise you won't overdo it.

00:11:13.533 --> 00:11:15.908
[giggles] Haven't you ever
heard the old saying,

00:11:15.992 --> 00:11:17.200
"No pain, no gain?"

00:11:17.283 --> 00:11:19.242
Maybe not too much pain, okay?

00:11:19.325 --> 00:11:21.367
Best of luck, Mystic Maya.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.117
Luck? Or skill?

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.492
[chuckles

00:11:24.575 --> 00:11:27.200
Iris. If you would, please
ring the bell at 10 PM

00:11:27.283 --> 00:11:28.200
for lights out.

00:11:28.283 --> 00:11:30.242
Yes. Of course, Sister.

00:11:33.367 --> 00:11:34.283
[PEARL whimpers]

00:11:34.367 --> 00:11:36.325
Hey, Pearl. If you'd like...

00:11:36.408 --> 00:11:38.367
...you can come
to my room for a bit.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.283
Maybe we could read
some books together.

00:11:40.367 --> 00:11:43.158
Yeah, that would be amazing!

00:11:43.242 --> 00:11:45.242
But, um... The truth is...

00:11:45.325 --> 00:11:48.033
I'm not really the
strongest reader just yet.

00:11:48.117 --> 00:11:50.200
[ELISE chuckles] Well,
then I'd be more than happy

00:11:50.283 --> 00:11:51.242
to help you improve.

00:11:51.325 --> 00:11:53.283
Aw! You're so nice!

00:11:53.367 --> 00:11:57.117
So, um... Do you think
you can tell me what this says?

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.533
That word is "gravely."

00:11:59.617 --> 00:12:02.617
[gasps]
And what's this word?

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.825
"Fruition." Those
are fairly difficult words.

00:12:05.908 --> 00:12:06.992
[PEARL gasps, giggles]

00:12:07.075 --> 00:12:09.492
[PHOENIX]
What the heck is she reading?

00:12:09.575 --> 00:12:11.408
[BUTZ]
All right, later, Nicky.

00:12:11.492 --> 00:12:13.367
Don't wanna keep
my canvas waiting.

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:15.367
All this snow ignites
an artistic fire

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:17.200
deep inside my soul.

00:12:17.283 --> 00:12:18.783
Just try and stop me!

00:12:18.867 --> 00:12:20.700
Why would I even wanna stop you?

00:12:22.908 --> 00:12:24.950
Looks like a bad winter storm.

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:29.158
[PHOENIX] That tree has
some kinda aura to it.

00:12:29.242 --> 00:12:30.783
Is it a weeping cherry?

00:12:30.867 --> 00:12:31.992
[IRIS gasps]

00:12:32.075 --> 00:12:34.242
[gasps]
Uh, hey, Iris.

00:12:34.325 --> 00:12:37.158
[gasps]
Sorry to bother you, good night.

00:12:37.242 --> 00:12:38.242
[PHOENIX]
Hang on!

00:12:39.492 --> 00:12:41.450
Mister Wright.
Do you need something?

00:12:41.533 --> 00:12:42.533
[gasps]

00:12:42.617 --> 00:12:44.158
[PHOENIX]
How does she know my name?

00:12:44.242 --> 00:12:46.283
Sorry. I'm being rude.

00:12:46.367 --> 00:12:49.158
But if you would... could you
take off your head scarf?

00:12:49.242 --> 00:12:50.158
[IRIS gasps]

00:12:50.242 --> 00:12:51.492
Please, miss.

00:12:55.825 --> 00:12:57.575
[PHOENIX] It's way more
than a resemblance.

00:12:57.658 --> 00:12:58.825
She's the same person.

00:12:58.908 --> 00:13:00.992
But... Dahlia is
still in prison!

00:13:05.158 --> 00:13:07.408
[IRIS] Mister Wright.
Is something wrong?

00:13:07.492 --> 00:13:09.367
Uh... Excuse me, Iris.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.283
But can we talk for a minute?

00:13:11.367 --> 00:13:12.283
[IRIS]
Sure.

00:13:12.367 --> 00:13:13.450
I appreciate it.

00:13:13.533 --> 00:13:15.450
When did you come
to Hazakura Temple?

00:13:15.533 --> 00:13:18.325
I've lived here ever
since I was a little girl.

00:13:18.408 --> 00:13:21.117
Because, I really don't
have any family to speak of.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:22.575
[PHOENIX] People come
here to train and boost

00:13:22.658 --> 00:13:24.533
their spiritual powers, right?

00:13:24.617 --> 00:13:27.492
[IRIS] Right. The temple
is loosely affiliated

00:13:27.575 --> 00:13:29.533
with the Kurain School
of Channeling.

00:13:29.617 --> 00:13:31.950
It does seem extremely
different from that place.

00:13:32.033 --> 00:13:33.450
I believe that's a good thing.

00:13:33.533 --> 00:13:35.200
[gasps]

00:13:35.283 --> 00:13:38.117
Communicating with the
dead has never helped anybody.

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:39.617
I don't like it at all.

00:13:41.242 --> 00:13:44.742
[IRIS gasps] Forgive me. I have
to ring the bell for lights out.

00:13:44.825 --> 00:13:46.825
Sorry, I didn't
mean to get in your way.

00:13:49.242 --> 00:13:51.408
Hey. Mister Wright?

00:13:51.492 --> 00:13:52.408
Yes?

00:13:52.492 --> 00:13:53.408
[IRIS]
If you don't mind...

00:13:53.492 --> 00:13:55.242
...I'd like you to take this.

00:13:55.325 --> 00:13:57.825
This scarf will protect
you from evil spirits.

00:13:57.908 --> 00:14:00.950
On a night like this,
you may need some extra help.

00:14:01.033 --> 00:14:02.450
Thanks, but what about you?

00:14:02.533 --> 00:14:04.825
Now don't worry about me.

00:14:04.908 --> 00:14:06.450
Thanks again.

00:14:06.533 --> 00:14:08.450
Uh. Iris?

00:14:08.533 --> 00:14:11.325
The two of us haven't ever
met before now have we?

00:14:11.408 --> 00:14:14.325
[gasps]
I have to get going.

00:14:14.408 --> 00:14:16.825
I have to ring
the bell at 10 PM.

00:14:16.908 --> 00:14:18.117
[PHOENIX gasps]

00:14:20.742 --> 00:14:24.783
[PHOENIX] She knows me.
There's not a doubt in my mind.

00:14:24.867 --> 00:14:27.450
Definitely need to bring it up
with her again tomorrow.

00:14:29.283 --> 00:14:30.908
[BIKINI]
Gyaaah!

00:14:30.992 --> 00:14:32.742
[PHOENIX gasps]
What the hell?

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:37.200
[gasps]

00:14:39.242 --> 00:14:40.325
[PHOENIX]
What is that?

00:14:47.783 --> 00:14:48.825
[gasps]

00:14:48.908 --> 00:14:49.992
Elise!

00:14:52.825 --> 00:14:57.408
[PHOENIX gasps]
Elise! Oh, no.

00:14:57.492 --> 00:14:58.450
[whimpers]

00:14:58.533 --> 00:14:59.450
[BIKINI grunts]

00:14:59.533 --> 00:15:03.658
[gasps]
Wait... Sister Bikini?

00:15:03.742 --> 00:15:04.658
Why are you on the ground?

00:15:04.742 --> 00:15:06.242
Obviously, because I passed out!

00:15:06.325 --> 00:15:09.242
Just hurry up and
call the police! Now!

00:15:09.325 --> 00:15:10.575
[PHOENIX]
Ah! You're right!

00:15:11.742 --> 00:15:13.200
I don't have my phone!

00:15:13.283 --> 00:15:15.783
I think I must've left it back
at the office or something.

00:15:15.867 --> 00:15:19.117
[gasps] There's a public phone
next to Dusky Bridge!

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.492
Run over there!

00:15:20.575 --> 00:15:21.575
[PHOENIX]
All right!

00:15:23.908 --> 00:15:25.033
[PHOENIX]
What the...?

00:15:27.617 --> 00:15:28.783
[gasps]

00:15:31.325 --> 00:15:32.950
[gasps]
No, Maya!

00:15:33.533 --> 00:15:35.867
[BUTZ] What the hell do you
think you're doing, man? Stop!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.700
[PHOENIX]
Hey! Let me go! Now!

00:15:37.783 --> 00:15:40.283
No way! The freakin'
bridge is on fire!

00:15:40.367 --> 00:15:42.033
[PHOENIX] Larry,
you gotta call the police!

00:15:42.117 --> 00:15:43.283
Huh?!

00:15:43.367 --> 00:15:44.283
[PHOENIX] I'm serious!
There's been a murder

00:15:44.367 --> 00:15:45.283
over at the temple!

00:15:45.367 --> 00:15:46.742
Wait, for real?

00:15:46.825 --> 00:15:47.950
[PHOENIX] I'm worried that
the killer might have tried

00:15:48.033 --> 00:15:49.908
to flee across the bridge!

00:15:49.992 --> 00:15:51.783
[PHOENIX] Maya's over there
inside the Inner Temple!

00:15:51.867 --> 00:15:53.825
[BUTZ]
What? I'm totally confused!

00:15:53.908 --> 00:15:56.117
[PHOENIX] Just get it together
and call the police!

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.492
I gotta help Maya!

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:02.950
[gasps]

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:08.742
[BUTZ]
Nicky!

00:16:08.825 --> 00:16:09.992
[PHOENIX screams]

00:16:17.867 --> 00:16:24.408
[Signal Samurai theme plays]

00:16:24.492 --> 00:16:26.408
--[MILES] Hello? Er, Larry?
--[BUTZ] Hey man,

00:16:26.492 --> 00:16:30.658
It's Laurice Deauxnim! It's bad!
Nick's in trouble, I think he--

00:16:30.742 --> 00:16:32.450
Tell me what happened.

00:16:38.617 --> 00:16:39.992
[coughs]

00:16:42.075 --> 00:16:43.700
[PHOENIX] Reading over
the transcript of Mia's

00:16:43.783 --> 00:16:47.075
very first case is
making my head spin.

00:16:47.158 --> 00:16:48.825
To think it all revolved
around events that

00:16:48.908 --> 00:16:50.783
took place on that same bridge.

00:16:50.867 --> 00:16:52.783
The defendant died
in the courtroom,

00:16:52.867 --> 00:16:55.283
and Dahlia was involved
in the whole thing.

00:16:55.367 --> 00:16:57.783
I had no idea about
some of this stuff.

00:16:57.867 --> 00:17:00.450
Almost as crazy as
what happened last night.

00:17:00.533 --> 00:17:01.950
Rushing across
that burning bridge,

00:17:02.033 --> 00:17:04.158
then plunging into
the icy river.

00:17:04.242 --> 00:17:05.867
I'll probably be in
the hospital for a while,

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:08.783
but it's a miracle
I even survived.

00:17:08.867 --> 00:17:10.950
I can't believe
I'm stuck here in this bed.

00:17:11.033 --> 00:17:12.908
I don't know exactly what
happened at the Temple,

00:17:12.992 --> 00:17:15.908
but the police started their
investigation of Elise's murder.

00:17:15.992 --> 00:17:18.867
And Iris is in custody as
their number one suspect.

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:20.533
I know she's not a murderer.

00:17:20.617 --> 00:17:21.992
But above all else...

00:17:22.075 --> 00:17:24.783
...I'm really worried about
what's going on with Maya.

00:17:24.867 --> 00:17:27.283
That bridge was the
only way for her to get back.

00:17:27.367 --> 00:17:30.450
So she's trapped
inside the Inner Temple.

00:17:30.533 --> 00:17:33.617
Dammit. I've gotta
find a way to help her.

00:17:34.908 --> 00:17:36.658
[MILES]
I'm shocked to see you're alive.

00:17:40.992 --> 00:17:42.200
[PHOENIX]
Miles?

00:17:43.908 --> 00:17:45.408
[MILES]
Larry called me last night.

00:17:45.492 --> 00:17:47.408
He was crying and
saying that you'd drowned.

00:17:47.492 --> 00:17:51.075
[PHOENIX grunts] Nope.
Fortunately, I am still alive.

00:17:51.158 --> 00:17:52.992
I guess luck was on my side.

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:58.325
Hey, Miles.
Thank you for coming here.

00:17:58.408 --> 00:18:00.200
Actually, it's just a
coincidence that I happened

00:18:00.283 --> 00:18:02.533
to be back in the country.
Only for a bit.

00:18:02.617 --> 00:18:05.783
[coughs]
This is pathetic,

00:18:05.867 --> 00:18:08.200
being stuck here
at a time like this.

00:18:08.283 --> 00:18:10.075
Wish I could clone myself.

00:18:10.158 --> 00:18:13.408
[gasps]
Miles. I need a favor!

00:18:13.492 --> 00:18:15.117
[MILES gasps]

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.700
[PHOENIX]
Take this.

00:18:22.575 --> 00:18:23.825
And do what with it?

00:18:23.908 --> 00:18:26.783
Please defend Iris!
She's not guilty!

00:18:26.867 --> 00:18:29.367
What? Hang on!
I'm a prosecutor!

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:32.117
I know. A great one.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:35.617
There's no problem.
I know you can do this.

00:18:41.075 --> 00:18:42.783
[MILES]
There's no turning back now.

00:18:45.075 --> 00:18:47.408
I'm Iris, a nun
at Hazakura temple.

00:18:47.492 --> 00:18:48.867
I'm Miles Edgeworth.

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:51.075
I was sent here at the
request of Phoenix Wright.

00:18:51.158 --> 00:18:53.658
[IRIS gasps] Really? So you've
actually talked to him?

00:18:53.742 --> 00:18:55.117
How is he doing?

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:56.575
[MILES]
All things considered,

00:18:56.658 --> 00:18:57.950
he's doing remarkably well.

00:18:58.033 --> 00:18:59.367
I'm so relieved!

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:01.700
At first I heard that
he didn't survive the fall.

00:19:01.783 --> 00:19:04.533
[MILES] Of course Larry had
to go and tell everyone that.

00:19:07.617 --> 00:19:08.908
[MILES]
This may seem odd,

00:19:08.992 --> 00:19:11.075
but I feel as though you
and I have met before.

00:19:11.158 --> 00:19:12.950
I don't see how that's possible.

00:19:13.033 --> 00:19:14.867
I hardly ever leave
Hazakura Temple,

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:16.283
so unless you've been there...

00:19:16.367 --> 00:19:18.408
Understood. Tell me.

00:19:18.492 --> 00:19:20.992
Are you there training to
boost your spiritual abilities?

00:19:21.075 --> 00:19:24.950
[IRIS] Mm-mm. I'm afraid
I don't have those abilities.

00:19:25.033 --> 00:19:28.158
For me, I'm strictly trying
to atone for my wrongdoings.

00:19:28.242 --> 00:19:29.825
The sins of my past.

00:19:29.908 --> 00:19:31.867
[IRIS]
I'm training to purify my soul.

00:19:32.825 --> 00:19:34.242
About last night...

00:19:34.325 --> 00:19:36.533
Can you share with me your
recollections of what happened?

00:19:36.617 --> 00:19:37.950
[IRIS]
Of course.

00:19:38.033 --> 00:19:40.075
After dinner I led the new
trainee and Sister Bikini

00:19:40.158 --> 00:19:42.533
across the bridge and
over to the inner temple,

00:19:42.617 --> 00:19:45.992
and then at 10 PM I rang
the bell for lights out.

00:19:46.075 --> 00:19:47.908
After that, I was
in my room until I heard

00:19:47.992 --> 00:19:49.367
all the commotion.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.283
I'm going to ask you directly.

00:19:51.367 --> 00:19:53.200
Did you murder
Elise Deauxnim last night

00:19:53.283 --> 00:19:55.075
on the Hazakura temple grounds?

00:19:55.158 --> 00:19:58.367
No. I swear it wasn't me.

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:00.242
Before coming here to see you.

00:20:00.325 --> 00:20:03.200
I paid a visit to Wright
at the hospital.

00:20:03.283 --> 00:20:05.492
He requested I do him a favor.

00:20:05.575 --> 00:20:07.908
That I act as your defense
attorney in the trial

00:20:07.992 --> 00:20:09.450
tomorrow morning.

00:20:09.533 --> 00:20:11.700
What? He really asked for that?

00:20:11.783 --> 00:20:14.283
[MILES]
He did. Be honest with me.

00:20:14.367 --> 00:20:15.992
You knew him
before this, correct?

00:20:16.075 --> 00:20:19.575
[IRIS gasps]
Why... would you think that?

00:20:19.658 --> 00:20:21.617
[MILES] He acted strangely
when your name came up

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:24.658
in our conversation.
He couldn't hide it from me.

00:20:24.742 --> 00:20:26.117
So let me ask you.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:28.867
Do you consider him to be
a friend Mister Edgeworth?

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:31.908
Without a doubt.
One of my oldest.

00:20:35.325 --> 00:20:37.200
You should know this.

00:20:37.283 --> 00:20:38.825
Five years ago,

00:20:38.908 --> 00:20:41.950
I betrayed his trust
and deceived him.

00:20:42.033 --> 00:20:43.492
What do you mean by that?

00:20:43.575 --> 00:20:47.450
[IRIS] Well. Long story,
but I was a weaker person then.

00:20:47.533 --> 00:20:50.575
I know that my cowardice
truly hurt Phoenix.

00:20:50.658 --> 00:20:52.450
I made a vow that
I would never show my face

00:20:52.533 --> 00:20:54.408
in his presence again.

00:20:54.492 --> 00:20:57.283
Whatever you did to him,
he's still hurting from it.

00:20:57.367 --> 00:20:58.950
I firmly believe
the only cure for

00:20:59.033 --> 00:21:00.700
that kind of pain is honesty.

00:21:00.783 --> 00:21:01.992
[gasps]

00:21:03.117 --> 00:21:04.825
[MILES]
It's not too late.

00:21:04.908 --> 00:21:07.325
You can tell him the
truth and set him free.

00:21:11.033 --> 00:21:13.367
[IRIS]
I will. I promise.

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:18.283
Very well, then.
I'll provide your defense.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:26.658
[MILES]
Okay. Now that's taken care of,

00:21:26.742 --> 00:21:28.658
it's time to begin
the investigation.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:31.450
[MILES] I'll have to try
a different approach

00:21:31.533 --> 00:21:34.950
in this trial. So I'll do
things your way, Wright.

00:21:36.158 --> 00:21:38.033
[PHOENIX]
I may be stuck here in bed.

00:21:38.117 --> 00:21:40.992
But the situation is going
to go on without me.

00:21:41.075 --> 00:21:42.700
And still...
The Inner Temple is cut off

00:21:42.783 --> 00:21:43.950
from everything.

00:21:46.158 --> 00:21:48.992
[PHOENIX] Poor Maya.
I really hope you're okay.

00:23:20.117 --> 00:23:21.575
[PHOENIX]
Objection!

00:23:21.658 --> 00:23:23.867
Iris is in jail, awaiting her
trial for the murder

00:23:23.950 --> 00:23:26.908
of Elise Deauxnim. But I have
faith my old friend Miles

00:23:26.992 --> 00:23:29.742
can argue her defense
in my absence.

00:23:29.825 --> 00:23:32.075
Maya is locked away
inside the inner temple.

00:23:32.158 --> 00:23:34.283
How strange that a setting
which figured so largely

00:23:34.367 --> 00:23:37.075
in Mia's first case has
come up once again.

00:23:37.158 --> 00:23:40.908
As the various motives come to
light, a shocking trial begins!

00:23:40.992 --> 00:23:43.492
Find the contradictions!
Believe in the truth!

00:23:43.575 --> 00:23:46.533
Next episode: "Bridge to the
Turnabout - 2nd Trial"!

00:23:46.617 --> 00:23:47.867
Take that!
